{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus datasource that scrapes the FindAir services",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    },
    {
      "name": "DS_ELASTICSEARCH_LOGS",
      "label": "FindAir Elasticsearch logs",
      "description": "Elasticsearch datasource configured with logs-findair-* and @timestamp",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "elasticsearch",
      "pluginName": "Elasticsearch"

    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    { "type": "grafana", "id": "grafana", "name": "Grafana", "version": "11.2.0" },
    { "type": "datasource", "id": "prometheus", "name": "Prometheus", "version": "1.0.0" },
    { "type": "datasource", "id": "elasticsearch", "name": "Elasticsearch", "version": "1.0.0" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "timeseries", "name": "Time series", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "stat", "name": "Stat", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "gauge", "name": "Gauge", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "bargauge", "name": "Bar gauge", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "state-timeline", "name": "State timeline", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "heatmap", "name": "Heatmap", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "table", "name": "Table", "version": "" },
    { "type": "panel", "id": "logs", "name": "Logs", "version": "" }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "FindAir pipeline traffic, latency, reliability, structured logs and Elastic APM trace correlation. Prometheus metrics intentionally contain no tenant/task/rule IDs; those filters query structured Elasticsearch logs.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### FindAir pipeline observability\nUse **job / metric service** for Prometheus panels and **environment / log service / tenant / rule / algorithm / image / task** for Elasticsearch log panels. Paste a `trace.id` into **Trace ID** to populate the Kibana APM link and correlated logs.\n\n**Accuracy note:** the existing `pipeline.end_to_end.duration` stops at TB Consumer ingress. The dashboard's full-pipeline latency card adds the successful TB Consumer stage average, so it is an aggregate approximation rather than an exact per-task measurement. Use the Kibana APM link for the exact trace waterfall already stored in Elastic.\n\n**Unavailable filters:** `sensor name` is not currently emitted as a structured telemetry field. ROI/area is intentionally not a metric label and should remain out because it is high-cardinality; add a bounded `area.id` or `region.code` to logs/spans if area filtering is required."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Healthy service targets",
      "description": "Number of selected Prometheus targets currently reporting up=1.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }, "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto", "wideLayout": true },
      "targets": [{ "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum(up{job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"})", "legendFormat": "healthy", "range": true, "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Target health",
      "description": "Percentage of selected scrape targets that are up.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "min": 0, "max": 100, "unit": "percent", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 90 }, { "color": "green", "value": 100 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "minVizHeight": 75, "minVizWidth": 75, "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "showThresholdLabels": false, "showThresholdMarkers": true, "sizing": "auto" },
      "targets": [{ "editorMode": "code", "expr": "100 * avg(up{job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"})", "legendFormat": "health", "range": true, "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pipeline input / second",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto", "wideLayout": true },
      "targets": [{ "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum(rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_direction=\"ingress\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "input/s", "range": true, "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Successful output / second",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto", "wideLayout": true },
      "targets": [{ "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum(rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_direction=\"egress\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "output/s", "range": true, "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tiles sent to Embedder",
      "description": "Successful TB Consumer egress messages during the selected dashboard range. This is an aggregate; task-level counts belong in logs/traces, not Prometheus labels.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto", "wideLayout": true },
      "targets": [{ "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum(increase({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\".*tb.consumer.*|.*tb-consumer.*\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_stage=\"tb_consumer\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_direction=\"egress\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"success\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "tiles", "range": true, "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Avg Gateway → Embedder latency (approx.)",
      "description": "Aggregate approximation: average gateway-origin-to-TB-Consumer-ingress duration plus average successful TB Consumer processing duration. Add a post-confirm end-to-end histogram for an exact Prometheus value.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 3, "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 2 }, { "color": "red", "value": 5 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "auto", "wideLayout": true },
      "targets": [{ "editorMode": "code", "expr": "(sum(rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]end_to_end[._]duration.*_sum\",job=~\"$job\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_stage=\"tb_consumer\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]end_to_end[._]duration.*_count\",job=~\"$job\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_stage=\"tb_consumer\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9)) + (sum(rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]stage[._]duration.*_sum\",job=~\"$job\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_stage=\"tb_consumer\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]stage[._]duration.*_count\",job=~\"$job\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_stage=\"tb_consumer\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9))", "legendFormat": "approx. average", "range": true, "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Input and successful output rate by service",
      "description": "Application-level pipeline messages. Gateway fan-out means downstream output can legitimately exceed upstream input.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "linear", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "gradientMode": "none", "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false, "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_direction=\"ingress\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} input", "range": true, "refId": "A" },
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_direction=\"egress\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"success\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} output", "range": true, "refId": "B" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Input/output totals in selected range",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "displayMode": "gradient", "maxVizHeight": 300, "minVizHeight": 16, "minVizWidth": 8, "namePlacement": "auto", "orientation": "horizontal", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "showUnfilled": true, "sizing": "auto", "valueMode": "color" },
      "targets": [
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (increase({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_direction=\"ingress\"}[$__range]))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} input", "range": false, "refId": "A" },
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (increase({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_direction=\"egress\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"success\"}[$__range]))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} output", "range": false, "refId": "B" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Stage latency: average and p95",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5, "gradientMode": "none", "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false, "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "p95", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]stage[._]duration.*_sum\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]stage[._]duration.*_count\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"}[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9)", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} avg", "range": true, "refId": "A" },
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]stage[._]duration.*_bucket\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} p95", "range": true, "refId": "B" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Pipeline stage duration distribution",
      "description": "Histogram buckets across the selected services.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 18 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "scaleDistribution": { "type": "log", "log": 2 } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "calculate": false, "cellGap": 1, "cellValues": { "unit": "short" }, "color": { "exponent": 0.5, "fill": "dark-orange", "mode": "scheme", "reverse": false, "scale": "exponential", "scheme": "Oranges", "steps": 64 }, "filterValues": { "le": 1e-9 }, "legend": { "show": true }, "rowsFrame": { "layout": "auto" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "showColorScale": false }, "yAxis": { "axisPlacement": "left", "reverse": false, "unit": "s" } },
      "targets": [{ "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (le) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]stage[._]duration.*_bucket\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "format": "heatmap", "legendFormat": "{{le}}", "range": true, "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pipeline non-success outcomes",
      "description": "Failures, retries, rejections and cancellations by service and outcome.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 35, "gradientMode": "none", "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false, "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["sum"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"failure\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} failure", "range": true, "refId": "A" },
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"retry\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} retry", "range": true, "refId": "B" },
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"rejected\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} rejected", "range": true, "refId": "C" },
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]pipeline[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\",imaging_pipeline_pipeline_outcome=\"cancelled\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} cancelled", "range": true, "refId": "D" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RabbitMQ sent and consumed rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5, "gradientMode": "none", "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false, "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"messaging[._]client[._]sent[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} sent", "range": true, "refId": "A" },
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"messaging[._]client[._]consumed[._]messages_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} consumed", "range": true, "refId": "B" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Service scrape availability",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "mappings": [{ "options": { "0": { "color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "color": "green", "index": 1, "text": "UP" } }, "type": "value" }], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "alignValue": "left", "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": false }, "mergeValues": true, "rowHeight": 0.9, "showValue": "auto", "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" } },
      "targets": [{ "editorMode": "code", "expr": "max by (service_name, k8s_pod_name) (up{job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"})", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} / {{k8s_pod_name}}", "range": true, "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Telemetry exporter pressure",
      "description": "Log HTTP exporter queue depth and dropped-log rate. Any sustained dropped rate requires investigation.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 34 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "gradientMode": "none", "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false, "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "max by (service_name) ({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]logs[._]queue[._]size\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"})", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} queued", "range": true, "refId": "A" },
        { "editorMode": "code", "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate({__name__=~\"imaging_pipeline[._]logs[._]dropped_total\",job=~\"$job\",service_name=~\"$metric_service\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} dropped/s", "range": true, "refId": "B" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Trace investigation in Elastic APM",
      "description": "Grafana's Elasticsearch datasource can query the trace-correlated logs but cannot render Elastic APM trace documents as a native Grafana waterfall.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 41 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Selected trace: `${trace_id}`\n[Open this trace in the Kibana APM waterfall](${kibana_base_url}/app/apm#/link-to/trace/${trace_id})\n\nThe table below shows logs carrying the same `trace.id`. Set **Kibana base URL** to the address of your Kibana instance. If you use a Kibana Space, include its path, for example: `https://kibana.example.com/s/findair`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Trace-correlated logs",
      "description": "Structured Elasticsearch logs for the selected trace. Replace the zero placeholder with a real Trace ID.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 49 },
      "datasource": { "type": "elasticsearch", "uid": "${DS_ELASTICSEARCH_LOGS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" }, "inspect": false }, "mappings": [], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 80 }] } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "trace.id" }, "properties": [{ "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "Filter dashboard to this trace", "url": "/d/findair-pipeline-observability/findair-pipeline-observability?${__url_time_range}&var-trace_id=${__value.raw}" }] }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "cellHeight": "sm", "footer": { "countRows": false, "fields": "", "reducer": ["sum"], "show": false }, "showHeader": true },
